City of Ghosts is a war, documentary film directed by Matthew Heineman.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
With unprecedented access, this documentary follows the extraordinary journey of “Raqqa is Being Slaughtered Silently”—a group of anonymous citizen journalists who
banded together after their homeland was overtaken by ISIS—as they risk their lives to stand up against one of the greatest evils in the world today.

